{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The dial indicator feels like a useful next tool because it adds alignment and runout checks to the measuring work I already do with my caliper.",
    "The threaded magnets and super glue fit my interest in fastening and repair: they offer removable mounts or bonds where screws, rivets, and tape may be awkward.",
    "The gloves fit the messy adhesive and repair work suggested by my purchases, while the wire connectors are a possible match if they fit my wire sizes and tools."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The takeout bags and portion cups serve food handling needs I do not currently have; being practical bulk supplies does not make them useful for my workshop projects.",
    "The transistor assortment assumes a circuit-building project, but my recent tools and hardware purchases mainly support mechanical fabrication and repairs.",
    "Roof sealant tape and specialized cleaning swabs need particular jobs to justify buying them; my adhesive and inspection-tool purchases alone do not establish those needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Buying assortments of fasteners seems to have been stretched into an interest in bulk packs of almost any supply, although I choose assortments for the sizes and functions my projects require.",
    "My interest in adhesives and repair tools seems to have been stretched across repair tasks with very different purposes, such as roof sealing and circuit work."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent rivets, rivet nuts, bolts, cutting wheels, and grommet press point toward joining, cutting, and mounting materials; complementary tools for those jobs feel especially relevant.",
    "Compatibility matters to my choices: thread sizes, wire gauges, suitable materials, and the tools I already have determine whether an otherwise useful supply fits my work.",
    "I engage with many workshop supplies, but a specialized item still needs a concrete use; frequent purchasing does not mean I need every kind of repair consumable."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my mechanical repair and fabrication interests, but stretched them into supplies for unrelated or unsupported tasks."
}"}
